            "text": "Yes. Naked Shake Pumpkin Spice uses cane sugar, Truvani and Be Well by Kelly use monk fruit, and Orgain uses erythritol and stevia, per their labels or listings at the time of writing. RYSE, the whey pick, uses sucralose and acesulfame potassium. For full control, make a DIY shake from an unsweetened vanilla, pumpkin purée, spice and a little maple syrup."
